@startuml
actor "Developer 1" as dev1
participant "Client App" as client
participant "API Gateway" as api
participant "Chat Service" as chat
participant "DevHub Listener" as devhub
database "PostgreSQL" as db
actor "GitHub API" as git

== Standard Messaging ==
dev1 -> client: Type & Send Message
client -> api: POST /api/messages
api -> chat: Route Message
chat -> db: Save Message
db --> chat: Confirm Save
chat --> api: Success
api --> client: Message Delivered (200 OK)

== Webhook Integration (Commit Card) ==
git -> devhub: Webhook Payload (Push Event)
devhub -> devhub: Parse & Verify Token
devhub -> chat: Generate "Commit Card"
chat -> db: Save Commit Message
chat -> client: Push Event via WebSocket
client -> dev1: Display Commit Card UI
@enduml